// Kiddo School — Weather, Seasons & What We Wear (Class 34) · Learning Path lessons.
// One individual flashcard teaching lesson per weather/clothing topic (owner
// doctrine: Learning Path = HOW to learn). Each lesson opens on its own
// /learn/{slug}/ page: the original Canva flashcard on the left, this
// step-by-step teaching content on the right, NO drawing canvas anywhere.
// Content is written fresh for teaching — the library card pages in
